    <string name="section_ashtray">Butt Bin (optional)</string>
    <string name="ashtray_intro">The Butt Bin is an ashtray with a plunger that counts every cigarette you stub out and stores it with the time, even when your phone is not nearby. This app collects the entries via Bluetooth. Without a Butt Bin the app works just the same, you simply count by hand.</string>
