    <string name="section_nc">Nextcloud (optional)</string>
    <string name="nc_hint">For users of their own Nextcloud with the app “cigarettecounter”: every entry is sent to the server; without a network it is queued and sent later. From server app 0.9.3 on, the device also takes over the state from the server, so several devices (e.g. a tablet) can be used in parallel. Note: when switched on, the server state replaces the entries on this device. Only one device should collect from the Butt Bin.</string>
